The conditions that are common to both the above entries are as follows;

"Provided that in case of ongoing project, the registered person shall exercise one time option in the Form at Annexure IV to pay central tax on construction of apartments in a project at the rates as specified for item (i.e.) or (if), as the case may be, by the 20th of May, 2019.

